.SH 歴史
.\" getnetgrent_r() is on Solaris 8 and AIX 5.1, but not the BSDs.
\fBsetnetgrent\fP(), \fBendnetgrent\fP(), \fBgetnetgrent\fP(), and \fBinnetgr\fP()  are
available on most UNIX systems.  \fBgetnetgrent_r\fP()  is not widely available
on other systems.
